  "title": "Vertiv announces leadership transition in EMEA region",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global leader in critical digital infrastructure, today announced that Karsten Winther will retire from his position as president, Europe, Middle East and Africa (EMEA), effective December 31, 2025. Paul Ryan, currently chief procurement officer, has been appointed as his successor, starting January 1, 2026.",
